{"dur": 69.13, "fps": 30, "segments": [{"id": "accroche", "text": "Eh ! Toi là… oui, toi, l'ingénieur !", "t0": 1.2, "t1": 3.553, "words": [{"w": "Eh", "t": 1.2}, {"w": "!", "t": 1.386}, {"w": "Toi", "t": 1.448}, {"w": "là…", "t": 1.695}, {"w": "oui,", "t": 2.253}, {"w": "toi,", "t": 2.5}, {"w": "l'ingénieur", "t": 2.748}, {"w": "!", "t": 3.491}]}, {"id": "intro", "text": "Moi, c'est Tonton Ferraille. Trente ans de chantier… et aujourd'hui, je vais te parler de CivRebar.", "t0": 3.933, "t1": 9.29, "words": [{"w": "Moi,", "t": 3.933}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 4.145}, {"w": "Tonton", "t": 4.463}, {"w": "Ferraille.", "t": 4.834}, {"w": "Trente", "t": 5.365}, {"w": "ans", "t": 5.736}, {"w": "de", "t": 5.948}, {"w": "chantier…", "t": 6.107}, {"w": "et", "t": 6.903}, {"w": "aujourd'hui,", "t": 7.062}, {"w": "je", "t": 7.698}, {"w": "vais", "t": 7.858}, {"w": "te", "t": 8.123}, {"w": "parler", "t": 8.282}, {"w": "de", "t": 8.653}, {"w": "CivRebar.", "t": 8.812}]}, {"id": "probleme", "text": "Sur un plan de ferraillage, chaque barre, chaque cadre, chaque cote… on les dessine à la main. Trait par trait. Poutre après poutre.", "t0": 9.67, "t1": 17.524, "words": [{"w": "Sur", "t": 9.67}, {"w": "un", "t": 9.908}, {"w": "plan", "t": 10.086}, {"w": "de", "t": 10.384}, {"w": "ferraillage,", "t": 10.562}, {"w": "chaque", "t": 11.276}, {"w": "barre,", "t": 11.693}, {"w": "chaque", "t": 12.05}, {"w": "cadre,", "t": 12.466}, {"w": "chaque", "t": 12.823}, {"w": "cote…", "t": 13.24}, {"w": "on", "t": 13.894}, {"w": "les", "t": 14.073}, {"w": "dessine", "t": 14.311}, {"w": "à", "t": 14.787}, {"w": "la", "t": 14.906}, {"w": "main.", "t": 15.084}, {"w": "Trait", "t": 15.382}, {"w": "par", "t": 15.739}, {"w": "trait.", "t": 15.977}, {"w": "Poutre", "t": 16.334}, {"w": "après", "t": 16.75}, {"w": "poutre.", "t": 17.107}]}, {"id": "erreurs", "text": "Résultat ? Des heures perdues… et des erreurs qui finissent sur le chantier.", "t0": 17.904, "t1": 22.043, "words": [{"w": "Résultat", "t": 17.904}, 