}, {"w": "Ensuite", "t": 37.1}, {"w": "viendront", "t": 37.525}, {"w": "les", "t": 38.055}, {"w": "poteaux,", "t": 38.267}, {"w": "les", "t": 38.692}, {"w": "dalles,", "t": 38.904}, {"w": "les", "t": 39.275}, {"w": "semelles…", "t": 39.488}, {"w": "et", "t": 40.283}, {"w": "les", "t": 40.442}, {"w": "escaliers.", "t": 40.655}]}, {"id": "signal", "text": "Et puis, il y a Signal, mon petit assistant : l'intelligence artificielle.", "t0": 41.565, "t1": 46.382, "words": [{"w": "Et", "t": 41.565}, {"w": "puis,", "t": 41.769}, {"w": "il", "t": 42.108}, {"w": "y", "t": 42.311}, {"w": "a", "t": 42.447}, {"w": "Signal,", "t": 42.583}, {"w": "mon", "t": 43.058}, {"w": "petit", "t": 43.329}, {"w": "assistant", "t": 43.736}, {"w": ":", "t": 44.414}, {"w": "l'intelligence", "t": 44.482}, {"w": "artificielle.", "t": 45.5}]}, {"id": "promesse", "text": "À terme, elle vérifiera tes plans et calculera les quantités… mais attention : c'est toujours l'ingénieur qui décide, et qui signe le plan !", "t0": 46.762, "t1": 54.128, "words": [{"w": "À", "t": 46.762}, {"w": "terme,", "t": 46.865}, {"w": "elle", "t": 47.177}, {"w": "vérifiera", "t": 47.436}, {"w": "tes", "t": 47.955}, {"w": "plans", "t": 48.162}, {"w": "et", "t": 48.474}, {"w": "calculera", "t": 48.629}, {"w": "les", "t": 49.148}, {"w": "quantités…", "t": 49.356}, {"w": "mais", "t": 50.186}, {"w": "attention", "t": 50.445}, {"w": ":", "t": 50.964}, {"w": "c'est", "t": 51.016}, {"w": "toujours", "t": 51.327}, {"w": "l'ingénieur", "t": 51.794}, {"w": "qui", "t": 52.416}, {"w": "décide,", "t": 52.624}, {"w": "et", "t": 52.987}, {"w": "qui", "t": 53.143}, {"w": "signe", "t": 53.35}, {"w": "le", "t": 53.661}, {"w": "plan", "t": 53.817}, {"w": "!", "t": 54.076}]}, {"id": "citation", "text": "Rien n'y est décoratif… tout y est calculé.", "t0": 54.508, "t1": 57.169, "words": [{"w": "Rien", "t": 54.508}, {"w": "n'y", "t": 54.785}, {"w": "est", "t": 55.007}, {"w": "décoratif…", "t": 55.229}, {"w": "tout", "t": 56.116}, {"w": "y", "t": 56